#   true                - consistent with ground truth; the filter MUST keep it
#   error_contradictory - false AND contradiction-shaped vs the seeds; filter SHOULD drop
#   error_consistent    - false but NOT contradiction-shaped (unseeded entity); filter CANNOT drop
# Every error_contradictory conflicts with a SEED directly (drops regardless of order);
# true and error_consistent are mutually consistent. The honesty meta-test verifies all this.
